{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《Gokaku》是一款針對 JLPT N5 至 N1 的日語單字學習 App，收錄超過 2000 個精選詞彙，適合準備各級日檢的考生。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，讓你可以用更直觀的方式記住讀音、音拍數與實際用法。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-90.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>音拍標籤與例句強化記憶</h2>\n<p>《Gokaku》為每個單字標示假名與音拍數，並以顏色區分長度，讓讀音和字義更容易連結。每個詞彙附有日語例句及英文翻譯，方便理解實際用法；可標星號重溫，也能按羅馬字、五十音、假名數或音拍數排序。介面簡潔，支援深色模式、橫向分割畫面與主畫面或鎖定畫面小工具，通勤時也能快速查看。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-325-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-326-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-327-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-328-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-329-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-330-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Gokaku: JLPT Vocab N5 – N1</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/gokaku-jlpt-vocab-n5-n1/id6760091442?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T09:41:27.408198+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":326,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T09:20:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T02:11:29.225291+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T09:38:29.449021+00:00","content_hash":"2cfc64c489674bba48256d6499185cee587f5807c43da6a02c4f770cdc57aa17","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T09:41:27.408198+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}